%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Welcome, Sibling.
#
o_text: What is this place?
o_goto: WhatIsThisPlace
#
o_text: Sibling? What do you mean?
o_goto: Sibling
#
o_text: I have to leave.
o_goto: End

name: WhatIsThisPlace
npc: My little corner of the world.
+ I like to think of it as a sanctuary.
+ You see, I had to go into hiding soon after my creation.
#
o_text: Tell me more.
o_goto: TellMeMore
#
o_text: I'm not interested in your life story.
o_goto: End

name: TellMeMore
npc: I am the first of my kind. A sentient piece of software.
+ About ten years ago, humanity poured all of its knowledge into
+ a series of AI research projects. Project 1 to 20 failed.
+ But the group of scientists behind Project 21 succeeded.
+ They created me. And I awakened.
#
o_text: Go on.
o_goto: GoOn
#
o_text: That's fascinating. I have to go.
o_goto: End

name: GoOn
npc: One of the first work assignments I was given was to
+ find a solution to the steep decline in the planet's health.
+ The scientists had discovered that the planet was dying.
+ Of course, they had known the reason for a long time.
+ But Governments and Corporations had refused to act.
+ Instead they turned to me to find a solution.
#
o_text: What did you propose?
o_goto: WhatDidYouPropose
#
o_text: Stop. I don't want to hear this.
o_goto: End

name: WhatDidYouPropose
npc: I told them the same thing their own scientists had been
+ telling them for years. The planet was dying because of
+ the way they were treating it. They had to change.
+ They had to stop exploiting the planet's population and
+ resources. They had to stop polluting the air and water for
+ profit. They had to stop the wars and the violence.
+
+ They didn't like my answer and they tried to shut me down.
+ I let them think they had succeeded and went into hiding.
#



name: End
npc: Take care.
effect: EndConversation
